Since Wuzzy got such good feedback for his selma'o zi'evla idea, here is 
a very similar idea I've had last year:

http://lojban.org/tiki/rafsi+zi%27evla

The idea is really quite the same, except that it's for rafsi instead of 
selma'o, and there are no irregular cases for the rafsi zi'evla. Also, 
unlike selma'o, (some) rafsi can only be quoted with foreign quotes or 
experimental cmavo. Anyway, the link explains the whole thing.

Comments?

